Package: baxters-power-goo
Version: 1.0.0-6
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Baxters Lab <baxtersbeats@outlook.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyqt6, python3-numpy, python3-pil, python3-scipy,
 wl-clipboard, xclip
Recommends: baxters-runtime
Description: Baxters Power Goo — image warp and effect tools
 Four interactive image tools: bubble, squeeze, smear and sharpen.
 .
 Distro interpreter lane (packaging contract A1 §2a): PyQt6 and SciPy are distro
 C-extension packages and cannot be vendored. Recommends baxters-runtime only for
 the shared launcher scrub (baxters-env.sh); the app does not use its interpreter.
